# Empty state
Empty State explains why a collection or view has no content and offers the most useful next action. Keep the copy short and avoid showing more than two actions.
<DocsExample title="Empty state" {source} {htmlSource}><Example /></DocsExample>

The HTML element accepts `title`, `description`, a default slot, plus `icon` and `actions` named slots.
